Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["JiraLink", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"1a520956-72d0-4395-a483-1fac88646165"],

Cell["last timestamp: 2026-08-08T20:01:38-07:00", "Text",
 CellTags->
  "mengToolbarTimestamp",ExpressionUUID->"75ed3d66-e460-457a-b0d4-\
eb41f3cd559f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A Wolfram Language client for the Jira REST API, targeting ",
 StyleBox["Jira Server / Data Center 9.x",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": platform API v2 (",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["/rest/api/2",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"3cbc72b0-0efa-48f1-a0b6-664f4f4d2fc3"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"8dfaf457-0a6b-454a-b953-f428accb9136"],
 "), the Agile API (",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["/rest/agile/1.0",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"933e2f0b-3790-4449-b6d0-af688264ce1b"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"b4cd91c7-85ea-44f1-93c1-1db7029a59f0"],
 "), Jira Service Management (",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["/rest/servicedeskapi",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"3f6c076f-ece3-4dd5-8ebd-a89009ecf4e8"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"6c37a82e-8297-463b-b063-bf4d146764bb"],
 "), and personal access tokens (",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["/rest/pat/latest",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"090e08dd-3723-4715-b734-07828467d38a"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"822412d4-8feb-4a49-97cf-fd7e90a84eab"],
 ")."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a41f3bcc-3bba-48fb-9d76-f8939b7ce61f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Jira Cloud's API v3 is not supported. Data Center does not serve it, and \
the two disagree about how users are identified: Data Center uses ",
 StyleBox["name", "TI"],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["key", "TI"],
 ", Cloud uses ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["accountId",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"cf02bbdc-91e8-41b7-92ec-827f0c92d8a6"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"14a54350-73b8-4584-9c3c-f3545714da65"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ced4fa20-4d04-46ba-bc4d-1a957884600c"],

Cell["\<\
The cells below are not evaluated in this notebook, because every one of them \
would talk to a live server. Evaluate them against your own instance. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d7f2247c-2e43-439f-b180-4f1ccfda66b4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Loading", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0cdd96a1-de98-4ebc-8afd-976cce3570c9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Load as a paclet, pointing at the repository that contains the ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["JiraLink",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"38e741c8-eda5-4e43-9f66-5d413077ee8b"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"8f8e332c-742b-4e61-8b29-682849499073"],
 " directory. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d20a48ec-248e-4c2c-b963-32319e4e5856"],

Cell["\<\
PacletDirectoryLoad[\"/path/to/repository-root\"];
Needs[\"JiraLink`\"]\
\>", "Program",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9952272948156977`*^9, 3.995227321907309*^9}},
 CellLabel->"",ExpressionUUID->"4f8b5eff-d2d0-4ed8-af80-9a7169f6f734"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"PacletDirectoryLoad", "[", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameDrop", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"-", "3"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<JiraLink`\>\"", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e975759f-1645-453f-9142-c83713a701f4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Loading has no side effects: it does not prompt, and it does not read any \
credential. That is what allows the package to be used from ",
 StyleBox["wolframscript", "TI"],
 " and from the test suite."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eb158b4b-4b87-4e18-ba05-52d069ecea11"],

Cell["\<\
The older route still works, and is convenient from inside this notebook. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bd8e53c2-fd3f-4121-bd24-afd951f353f0"],

Cell["\<\
PrependTo[$Path, FileNameDrop[NotebookDirectory[], -4]];
Needs[\"JiraLink`\"]\
\>", "Program",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.995227329842237*^9},ExpressionUUID->"42dbef53-4093-4572-bafe-\
3f9da4759780"],

Cell[BoxData["$JiraLinkVersion"], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6a5abd72-c752-408d-9d89-e8a4f8c14e77"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Connecting", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"23ac161d-0904-49b6-88a4-4c0f747c5d8e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Personal access tokens are the recommended credential on Data Center. \
Create one from your Jira profile under ",
 StyleBox["Personal Access Tokens",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ", then store it once in the operating system's secure credential storage. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0626bae7-6d06-42b7-ba2c-c9fd54bb9b23"],

Cell["\<\
Call it with the URL alone and it prompts in a masked field, then stores what \
you type. The token is never typed into the notebook, so it cannot end up in \
the input history or in the saved file.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d62d8c47-eff2-49c8-aa9c-a80d4d02fa83"],

Cell["JiraStoreCredential[\"https://jira.example.com/jira\"]", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.995231089752163*^9, 
  3.9952310917448673`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4bbb4bdb-fdb5-4847-8359-\
cc484ef2497d"],

Cell["To store a username and password instead of a token:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f53a1ede-8d56-44be-ac23-40c013958a53"],

Cell["\<\
JiraStoreCredential[\"https://jira.example.com/jira\", \"Basic\"]\
\>", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.995231100607423*^9},ExpressionUUID->"86355e6f-5460-41e4-a438-\
5afd4d886a63"],

Cell["\<\
Storing is a one-time step. Afterwards JiraConnect needs only the URL, and \
nothing secret appears anywhere in this notebook.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cabde485-3b71-4d02-ac90-27dd53a32285"],

Cell["\<\
Avoid the explicit form JiraStoreCredential[url, <|\"Token\" -> \"...\"|>] in \
a notebook: the token would be saved in the .nb file as plain text and would \
survive in version control. It exists for scripts that get the secret from \
somewhere else.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"db21774a-8bd8-472a-99f4-97b986a2f2e5"],

Cell["\<\
Note that evaluating SystemCredential[\"JiraLink:jira.example.com\"] directly \
would print the stored token, and that output would be saved with the \
notebook. The connection object returned by JiraConnect masks it; raw \
secure-storage lookups do not.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"39445be0-8379-4a46-a632-2548cab50ace"],

Cell["Thereafter, connecting needs only the URL. ", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fb7f6a53-9dab-4967-ae91-029ee7239af0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"JiraConnect", "[", "\"\<https://jira.example.com/jira\>\"", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.995231105472355*^9},ExpressionUUID->"9bc9bc21-add0-4d9f-ab33-\
c4e4a9b250bb"],

